{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["北国必遭审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法莲酒徒引以为荣的华冠有祸了！",{"text":"它坐落在醉酒者肥美的山谷顶上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它的荣美如将残之花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，主有一位强壮有力的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像冰雹和带来毁灭的暴风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像汹涌泛滥的洪水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必把华冠摔在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲酒徒引以为荣的华冠必被践踏在脚下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那荣美的将残之花在肥沃的山谷之巅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它必像夏季到来之前早熟的无花果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人一看见它就把它摘下吞掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，万军之耶和华必作祂余民的荣冠和华冕，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必使审判官公正断案，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐力量给守城退敌之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祭司和先知也因醉酒而摇摇晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因烈酒而东倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们因烈酒而摇摇晃晃、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酩酊大醉，东倒西歪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们错解异象，糊涂判案。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桌子上到处都是呕吐之物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一片狼藉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们抱怨说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“祂想教导谁知识呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂想把信息解释给谁呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是刚刚断奶、离开母怀的婴孩吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂的教导只是命命令令、命命令令、律律例例、律律例例、这里一点、那里一点。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"因此，耶和华必用外族人的口和陌生的语言来教训他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华曾对他们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“这是安歇之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让疲乏的人安歇吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是安歇之地。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却不肯听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，对他们来说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的话成了命命令令、命命令令、律律例例、律律例例、这里一点、那里一点，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们走路时仰面跌倒，摔伤，落网，被捉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你们这些好讥讽、在耶路撒冷统管百姓的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听耶和华的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我们已经和死亡立约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与阴间结盟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"势不可挡的灾难席卷而来时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们会安然无恙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们以谎言为庇护所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以诡诈为藏身处。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我要在锡安放一块基石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一块经过考验的石头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一块根基稳固的宝贵房角石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠的人必不会恐慌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以公平为准绳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公义作线锤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冰雹必砸碎你们虚谎的庇护所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪水必淹没你们的藏身处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们和死亡所立的约必被废弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与阴间的结盟必不能长久。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"势不可挡的灾难席卷而来时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必遭践踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"灾难必不分昼夜、日复一日地袭来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每次袭来都必掳掠你们。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白这信息的人都必惊恐万分。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的床太小，不能舒身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的被子太窄，不足裹身。","poem":1},{"noteId":14}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必像在毗拉心山一样挺身而出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在基遍谷一样发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要完成祂奇异的作为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就祂不寻常的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在你们不要再讥讽了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免你们的捆索更沉重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我已从主——万军之耶和华那里听到毁灭全国的谕旨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要侧耳听我的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心听我的话语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道农夫会一直耕地而不撒种吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道他会一直犁地、耙地吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他整平土地之后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不种小茴香、大茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按行种小麦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在合适的地方种大麦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在田边种粗麦吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他的上帝指点他，教导他耕种之道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"打小茴香不用大槌，用木棍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打大茴香不用石磙，用木棒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做饼的粮食要磨碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有人会不停地在场上碾压粮食。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"马拉着石磙在场上轧过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会把粮食磨碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些知识都是万军之耶和华所赐的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂有奇妙的谋略和伟大的智慧。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"此处的床和被子象征他们虚假的安全感。","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}